{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#959","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#959","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#959\",\"parent_revision\":\"77106da647a17ac2014547c4da66657a02a8834de463432a2b283549b30a1a3c\",\"root_revision\":\"77106da647a17ac2014547c4da66657a02a8834de463432a2b283549b30a1a3c\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nMigrate language-agnostic SAM workflow skills from python3-development to development-harness.\\n\\nSkills to migrate (all confirmed language-agnostic except noted Python-specific parts):\\n\\n1. **implement-feature** \u2014 SAM execution loop. dh already has identical copy at `workflows/execution/SKILL.md` marked `user-invocable: false`. Make dh version user-invocable, remove python3-dev copy.\\n\\n2. **start-task** \u2014 individual task claim and dispatch. Language-agnostic. Hook path in frontmatter (`${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/../../implementation-manager/scripts/task_status_hook.py`) must be updated after hook scripts migrate (depends on hook script migration item).\\n\\n3. **complete-implementation** \u2014 quality gates after all tasks complete. Language-agnostic EXCEPT Phase 1 hardcodes `code-reviewer` agent (Python-specific). Migration requires resolving code-reviewer via language manifest role resolution.\\n\\n4. **add-new-feature** \u2014 SAM planning pipeline. Language-agnostic EXCEPT Phase 3 hardcodes `python-cli-design-spec` agent. Migration requires resolving architect role via language manifest.\\n\\n5. **t0-baseline-capture** (agent) \u2014 runs check commands, records output. Fully language-agnostic. Move to `dh/agents/`.\\n\\n6. **tn-verification-gate** (agent) \u2014 re-runs checks, compares against baseline. Fully language-agnostic. Move to `dh/agents/`.\\n\\nSkills that should NOT migrate:\\n- `orchestrate` \u2014 entirely Python-specific entry point, belongs in python3-development\\n\\nDependency: Hook script migration must complete first (for start-task hook path).\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the codebase**, I want to **migrate implement-feature, start-task, complete-implementation, add-new-feature skills and bookend agents to development-harness** so that **the code is cleaner and more maintainable**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Session 2026-03-21: skill-migration-comparison report (.claude/reports/skill-migration-comparison-2026-03-21.md)\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-21\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"279b3da2692e0aa79fad4d173a224fd746c8669cb589af25183832317ad48e42\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVWYP7w\"}"}